flowchart LR
    subgraph python["Python issue orchestrator components"]
        entry["implement_issue"]
        impl["_implement_issue_impl"]
        loop["run_coding_loop - imported"]
        checkpoint["checkpoint helpers"]
        verify["_run_verification - conditional"]
        result["IssueBuildResult constructor"]
    end
    subgraph go["Go full-build orchestrator components"]
        handlers["Handlers registration"]
        build["Build"]
        dispatch["Deps call boundary - imported roles"]
        goresult["BuildResult / ReasonerFailed"]
    end
    entry -->|delegate issue implementation| impl
    impl -->|execute scoped issue| loop
    impl -->|normal or interrupted salvage| checkpoint
    impl -->|verify when coding and commits pass| verify
    impl -->|structured result after cleanup| result
    handlers -->|build handler| build
    build -->|plan execute verify and fix| dispatch
    build -->|result plus optional failed error| goresult
